index fcd0bdd..d900364 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,4 +1,8 @@
-## 0.5.254 (build 294)
+## 0.5.254 (build 295)
+
+Build 295 keeps build 294's file fixes and stops the Work board from rebuilding itself on every pixel of a resize.
+
+- **Resizing Work**: the board's rows are built once when the tasks, files or session check change, not once per column and not again while the window is dragged. The wide layout (the sidebar beside the board) updates only when the window crosses 900 pt, and the session row updates only when cards start or stop running under Start work. A resize that stays on the wide layout does not rebuild the cards.
 
 Drop files on a Work card, and their paths go out with the work. COS Control only: no server release. Works with server 6.59.0. Build 294 is QA round 1's fixes on build 293, which was installed for review only.
 
